 "post": {
  "instagram": "Gap fill in 4 steps: 1) mark yesterday's close, 2) let the first 15 minutes trade, 3) enter on a close below their low with a stop above the day's high, 4) target yesterday's close. Example: 1.1% gap, entry 100.96, stop 101.73, target 100.00. Skip it when big news caused the gap.\n\nSave this for later and follow @calmedgeofficial for one trading concept a day.\n\nEducational example on an illustrative chart. Not financial advice; trading involves risk of loss.\n\n#gapfill #daytradingstrategy #gaptrading #tradingeducation #technicalanalysis #daytrading #trading #learntotrade",
